  $demo$The Fall of the House of Usher$demo$, $demo$A man visits his childhood friend Roderick Usher in a crumbling house by a dark lake. The friend is ill, his sister is dying, and the house itself seems to be listening.

Source edition: 1839.$demo$, 'en',
